    description: { small: "You're in cavern with waterfall.", big: "You are in a magnificent cavern with a rushing stream, which cascades\nover a sparkling waterfall into a roaring whirlpool which disappears\nthrough a hole in the floor.  Passages exit to the south and west." },
    sound: 174, loud: false,
